Error [jet.InvalidOutput]: Output entry `run` has the wrong callable contract
  --> tests/ui/output_entry_run_returns_value.jet:4:1
    |
  4 | fn run() -> Int {
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: An Executable takes zero or one typed CLI parameter and declares no return type, or only a unit error contract such as `IOError!`
 Fix: Declare the entry as `fn run()` or `fn run() IOError!`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1321
